# instruction of 2026-09-25 -- "update the citation to include all authors" --
# and replacing the single-author list this file carried through 1.0.0 and
# 1.1.0. Affiliations are the article's front matter, without the postal codes.
# The study the testbed was built for is still a separate work with its own
# citation, which is not restated here; only the people are the same.
